  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Livelihood and Food Security</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">(Pakistan):  .The Livelihood and Food Security activity (LFSA), aims to improve livelihoods and food security through agriculture-led growth in Sindh province and other flood affected areas. The goal is to rebuild and strengthen sustainable livelihood assets by reducing vulnerabilities to shocks through agriculture system efficiency improvements for the most vulnerable small and flood-affected farmers, particularly in Sindh province. The LFSA will recover disrupted agriculture systems including cropping, livestock, and irrigation infrastructure for small farmers affected by the 2022 floods. The activity will provide agriculture inputs such as wheat seed and fertilizer to flood-affected households to restore disrupted agriculture cropping in the most food-insecure flood-affected districts of Pakistan....</narrative>
  </description>
